Subject: [PATCH] fix(api): return 405 for unsupported HTTP method (C4b)

- GlobalExceptionHandler: HttpRequestMethodNotSupportedException -> 405 + Allow header
  (was caught by the generic handler as 500; found in C4 live server check 3-7)
- Unit test for the handler

